# Normain App — Permissions Catalog

> Working list of every permission available in the Normain app. Feeds the roles/permissions section of the KPMG deliverable.

| Permission | Description | Scope |
|---|---|---|
| Create team | Create a new team within the organization | Org |
| Add member to org | Add a new user to the Normain organization | Org |
| Add member to team | Add a user to any team | Org |
| Add member to team I'm a part of | Add a user to a team the acting user is a member of | Team |
| Setup SharePoint integration | Configure the SharePoint integration for the organization | Org |
| Assign SharePoint site to team | Connect a SharePoint site to a specific team | Team |

> ⚠️ Incomplete — add remaining permissions as they are identified.
